ta4j-cli source provenance

This repository was extracted from ta4j/ta4j PR #1610 lineage at commit
2b421c17eb8370a3f8eea576b99e30252e6dec3f:
https://github.com/ta4j/ta4j/commit/2b421c17eb8370a3f8eea576b99e30252e6dec3f

Initial application source, unit tests, command documentation, and the performance
comparison helper originated in that commit's ta4j-cli/ directory. The Maven
Wrapper, Eclipse formatter, SPDX header, Java review conventions, and author list
originated in the same commit's repository-root configuration.

The fixed owned fixtures were copied unchanged from that commit's
 ta4j-examples/src/main/resources/AAPL-PT1D-20130102_20131231.csv
 ta4j-examples/src/main/resources/Binance-ETH-USD-PT5M-20230313_20230315.json
into fixtures/. They are regression/demo inputs, not a live-data service.

Original MIT attribution is retained in LICENSE, AUTHORS, and source headers.
The standalone CLI owns application composition and its independent release
lifecycle. Reusable production library implementations remain owned by upstream
ta4j-core, ta4j-data, ta4j-charting, and ta4j-catalog; existing ta4jexamples.* package
names are intentionally retained by those upstream artifacts for compatibility.
